@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Resumefolio | Constraint review
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify candidate rule / constraint and affected behavior;
:Classify domain rule, policy, project constraint or external obligation;
:Locate authority, source date and actual applicability facts;
if (Authority and applicability established?) then (yes)
 :Trace affected requirements and realistic options;
 if (Material conflict or change?) then (yes)
  :Record impacts, costs, risks and owner disposition; <<#49351C>>
 else (no)
  :Record justified compatible treatment; <<#173B34>>
 endif
 :Update reviewed requirements and dependent design decisions;
 :Plan and later retain actual verification evidence;
else (pending)
 :Record gap, owner and dependent decision gate; <<#49351C>>
endif
stop
legend bottom
Published guidance, project interpretation and actual verification are distinct.
No unknown applicability is treated as established compliance.
endlegend
@enduml
